{"availability":"available","full":"baryon/markdown-live-preview","name":"markdown-live-preview","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2026-02-04T03:17:06Z","updated":"2026-03-12T10:36:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=baryon.baryon-markdown-live-preview","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:28.837Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:28.837Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:28.837Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:37:33.169Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:25.321Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:48.609Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:28.837Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modern VS Code extension for previewing Markdown — built for the AI era, where documents are generated first and read second.","Preview-first. Because in the age of AI, you read more Markdown than you write.","AI tools like Claude, ChatGPT, and Copilot generate Markdown at scale — technical docs, reports, slide decks, research notes. The bottleneck is no longer writing; it's reviewing and presenting what was written. Markdown Live Preview is designed around this reality: open a file, see it rendered, navigate it, present it."],"features":["Default open mode is configurable: edit, preview, or side-by-side.","15 built-in mermaid themes: github-light, github-dark, tokyo-night, catppuccin-mocha, dracula, nord, solarized-light, and more. An ASCII rendering mode is also available for terminal-friendly output.","Alice -> Bob: Hello Bob --> Alice: Hi","Supported languages: PlantUML, GraphViz/DOT, D2, Ditaa, BlockDiag, Mermaid, Nomnoml, Pikchr, Excalidraw, SVGBob, Structurizr, ERD, DBML, TikZ, WireViz, and more.","Supported chart types: LineChart, BarChart, AreaChart, PieChart, ComposedCha